[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4816747643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-4816747643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":4816747643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHxm8ew","user":{"login":"relzz-v0","id":2993425,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTM0MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2993425?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0","html_url":"https://github.com/relzz-v0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/relzz-v0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T10:28:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T10:28:09Z","body":"Oh I just had this issue, glad there is a PR ready for it I hope it gets merged tho it doesn't seem that stable I haven't tested the patch tho, maybe you guys are using low qualities in your tests? It is definitely more stable tho.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4816747643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4819588303","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-4819588303","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":4819588303,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH0UUzw","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T17:12:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T17:12:28Z","body":"Yeaaaaah I suspected variable pancaking could cause some issues. I hadn't thought of moving the camera alongside the scene though.\r\n\r\nThat said, I assume that people would set their pancake large enough that shadows cast properly in their scenes, even from large objects. The PR only ever makes the pancake larger or equal to the user-assigned pancake value, so scenes that didn't have issues with insufficient pancake size should keep working fine... Unless having a very large pancake causes precision issues of some kind (16-bit shadowmaps and all).\r\n\r\nI added it in because it slightly improves shadow stability, whether it's worth it or not probably isn't for me to decide :sweat_smile:\r\n\r\nEither way instructions for how to disable variable pancaking are in the PR post.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4819588303/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4819739275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-4819739275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":4819739275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH0diiw","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T17:34:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T17:34:49Z","body":"> it doesn't seem that stable\r\n\r\nThis PR works by making the calculations for shadows more precise, which makes shadows more stable when far from the origin, but there's a limit to this approach. Eventually when distance gets large enough, it stops being an issue of how precise the computation is and it becomes one of simply not having enough numbers to get the subpixel-level precision needed for stable shadows.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure how or even if other engines deal with this kind of thing.\r\n\r\nThere might be ways to make this better or even perfect, but I can't really think of anything else, let alone getting a PR up for that :|\r\n\r\nDo keep in mind that the shadows I showed are 8km from origin, and Calinou's are 10km. That's pretty far and you're probably going to start having other issues beyond shadows at that point.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4819739275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4918689617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-4918689617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":4918689617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJS0_UQ","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T19:56:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T19:56:39Z","body":"Rebased and applied Skyth's changes from #120774. Turns out that with that fix applied, there was a small error on my part in how I handled PCSS, but that's now fixed.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/457af799-7998-473b-bb30-2b59eb5444d9\r\n\r\nThere are white bright spots appearing in shaded areas when using PCSS for some reason, but I checked master on commit 56d440ff546f1a4bf3a120d7136969f11964aea3 and confirmed the issue isn't caused by this PR.\r\n\r\nDemo scene shown in the video:\r\n\r\n[shadow_cull_mrp-4.8.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29816258/shadow_cull_mrp-4.8.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4918689617/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5181110156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-5181110156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":5181110156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNNF3jA","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T15:22:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T15:22:46Z","body":"Rebased.\r\n\r\nSince I was at it, this is what Calinou's test scene looks like in this PR without variable pancaking:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/007bf231-17ef-41b0-8de3-913597bddde5","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5181110156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5433205733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-5433205733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":5433205733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQ9gj5Q","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T01:30:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T01:30:41Z","body":"Had a quick look at this during the rendering meeting today, code looks ok but I'd like to have some more insight into why this is better than the original. It's a bit unclear what the key point is that improved it. The location snapping might still exhibit the same behaviour but in different edge cases.\r\n\r\nThat said, it does look like testing shows improvement and I'd like to test if I can reproduce similar improvements in XR where this issue is much more noticable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5433205733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5465426277","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-5465426277","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":5465426277,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRcPJZQ","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T23:11:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T23:11:19Z","body":"While I haven't done testing on this, I would say that some of the factors that contribute to the increased stability when far from the origin are:\r\n- camera frustum size is computed in view space instead of world space, which means that its frustum is completely independent from the camera transform and will thus always have the same exact radius. This radius is then used to determine snap grid size, so if it's numerically unstable at all, like it currently is without the PR, it produces some nasty results.\r\n- I suspect, but I am not 100% sure, that working without transform offsets and applying them only at the end helps somewhat\r\n- there's also variable pancaking, which doesn't improve the computation accuracy by itself, but helps keep the shadow camera pinned into a fixed set of positions, which reduces flickering somewhat, though this also causes problems in some cases as Calinou's testing showed. This is easy to remove if necessary (see PR description)\r\n\r\nPart of the reason for which the PR is the way that it is, is that's it's based on #119867 but with the draw rect code removed.\r\n\r\nDoing all processing with `double` even in fp32 builds might give better results (I haven't tested), but that would mean not being able to use `Vector3` and `Transform3D`, which seemed like a pain in terms of code so I opted against it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5465426277/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5569498579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119705#issuecomment-5569498579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119705","id":5569498579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABS_fN0w","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-07T10:49:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T10:49:36Z","body":"Squashed changes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5569498579/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]